<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48528" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tonsōrĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		tondeo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			shearing</i> or <i>shaving</i>, <i>tonsorial</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">culter,</span>”
				<i>a razor</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Off. 2, 7, 25</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Petr. 108</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferramenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					14, 36</span></i>
			
			<i>in lemm.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
					Aur. Tard. 2, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cultellus,</span>”
				<i>for cutting nails</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 3, 2, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferramenta,</span>”
				<i>for shearing sheep</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 43, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
